  "body_text": "接下来\n我们会推出一个ALL-IN-ONE 主题系列的拼配产品\n第一个上场的是 -\n蔓飞龙 ALL-IN-ONE\nFlying Dragon SDN-1\nFlying Dragon SDN-2\nFlying Dragon SDN-3\nFlying Dragon SDH-1\nFlying Dragon SDH-2\n3只日晒与2只蜜处理，是2020产季我们在蔓飞龙最好的量产产品\n目前几轮测试下来的风味表现\n红色水果（樱桃，蔓越莓，李子）\n热带水果 （菠萝，番石榴，百香果）\n黄色水果（橙子，黄柠檬）\n甜感扎实（蜂蜜）\n口感圆润（有粘稠感）厚实\n不足的是，由于豆子的瑕疵无法100%剔除，还是有几率出现爆米花壳类的木质类气息，但瑕不掩瑜，哈哈哈哈哈哈哈～\n浦东和浦西店，均已到位\n养豆至8月中下开始出品\n，请耐心期待哦～\n以上",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          接下来\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我们会推出一个ALL-IN-ONE 主题系列的拼配产品\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          第一个上场的是 -\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           蔓飞龙 ALL-IN-ONE\n          </strong>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Flying Dragon SDN-1\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Flying Dragon SDN-2\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Flying Dragon SDN-3\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Flying Dragon SDH-1\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Flying Dragon SDH-2\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          3只日晒与2只蜜处理，是2020产季我们在蔓飞龙最好的量产产品\n         </span>\